    "title": "18th Annual Boone County Senior Health & Wellness Expo Set for October 3 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Melissa Jacobs ,\n21 hours ago The 18th Annual Boone County Senior Health & Wellness Expo will be held Saturday, October 3, from 9 a.m. to noon at the Boone County 4-H Fairgrounds in Lebanon. The event is free and open to all attendees. Boone County seniors, caregivers and family members are encouraged to attend and visit with more than 50 vendors offering information, services and resources. Read full article",
